HADOOP-13699. Configuration does not substitute multiple
 references to the same var.

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the configuration system not properly handling multiple references to the same variable within a configuration string, leading to incorrect or unexpected behavior during variable substitution. Specifically, the system failed to detect self-referential substitutions, which could result in infinite loops or unresolved variables.

